[statement]
A package whose condition has only `!` entries is triggered by placing a
package one of them names at a version it does not forbid: placing `a` 2
walks `q`, whose condition is `!a=1`, at once, its dependency `e` before
it, ahead of `m`.

[repository]
P:q
V:1
D:e
i:!a=1

P:a
V:2

P:e
V:3

P:m
V:1

[request]
a
m

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 2
install e 3
install q 1
install m 1
